{"step_index":1232,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:43:40Z","input_tokens":5413,"cache_read_tokens":196758,"output_tokens":513,"content":"Prepared the implementation plan in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) (`Patch 1.0.24`).\n\n### Proposed Changes\n- **[teacher.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html):**\n  - Remove the `Reset` tab button (`#tab-btn-reset`), `#view-reset`, `#reset-lock-btn`, `#reset-status-msg`, and `pendingAction` state.\n  - Update the `#confirm-modal` warning to:\n    `Clearing students also resets the response lock. Are you sure this is what you want?`\n  - Combine response-lock reset into `Clear Students` (`#clear-sub-btn`): on confirmation, execute `EncryptedLocalDB.purgeRecords(quizId)` and `EncryptedLocalDB.patchField(quizId, 'lockEpoch', nextEpoch)` concurrently via `Promise.all`, update `currentLockEpoch`, clear any same-browser `localStorage` lock, and refresh `#sub-feed`.\n  - Leave [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) and `quizzes/template` unchanged (`checkRemoteUnlock` already reads `lockEpoch`).\n- **One tradeoff to confirm:** Because `Patch 1.0.23` hides `Clear Students` whenever `Auto Record Quiz` is `OFF`, removing the `Reset` tab means response lock resets will only appear when `Auto Record Quiz` is `ON`.\n\nPlease review [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and confirm if you want me to proceed as planned (or keep a lock-reset control available when Auto Record Quiz is `OFF`)."}
