\\n     `Clearing students also resets the response lock. Are you sure this is what you want?`\\n3. **`index.html` Remains Untouched:**\\n   - `index.html` (`checkRemoteUnlock(data)`) already inspects `quizzes/{quizId}.lockEpoch` on load whether `autoRecordQuiz` is `true` or `false`, requiring zero changes to `index.html` or `quizzes/template`.\\n\\n## Research & Optimization Rationale\\n- **Concurrent Execution (`Promise.all`):** Executing `Promise.all([EncryptedLocalDB.purgeRecords(quizId), EncryptedLocalDB.patchField(quizId, 'lockEpoch', nextEpoch)])` runs submission deletion and `lockEpoch` patching concurrently instead of sequentially, while reusing existing chunked-batch (`<=500`) and masked `PATCH` helpers (DRY).\\n- **Zero Extra Network Reads on OFF Mode:** After `Promise.all(...)` resolves, `await refreshSubmissions()` im\n<truncated 4741 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\\\implementation_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
