nload process also uses `quizzes/quiz_2/submissions` and checks `quizzes/quiz_2.lockEpoch` within the code. Also, the plan needs to eliminate any unpredictable or unnecessary modifications of the document's `<title>`. The code can be DRYer using `EncryptedLocalDB.patchField(id, fieldName, val)` with the method `EncryptedLocalDB.patchFields(id, obj)`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for adding the Quiz Dashboard in te